Design decisions taken this phase, both from evidence rather than plan:
  1. Unlock parity - stepping advances progress only; confirm unlocks via the same
     end() path as pointer release, under the same conjunctive final-segment
     condition. Prevents keyboard users doing more work than pointer users and
     avoids reintroducing the defect 6c8c6fb closed.
  2. Slider normalisation - role=slider moves to the container div in all three
     adapters. tabindex on an SVG <g> is not reliably focusable in WebKit, which
     the CI matrix tests.

